cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Anonymized for double-blind review."
title: "CheckCite"
abstract: >
  CheckCite is an open citation-verification system for scientific
  papers. It combines a deterministic existence cascade and metadata
  validation with a multi-query retrieval method that decomposes each
  citing sentence into sub-claims, retrieves evidence for every
  sub-claim, and verifies the full claim against the unioned passage
  set. The system returns per-reference verdicts paired with the
  evidence passage used to ground them.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - citation verification
  - scientific-paper analysis
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - human-in-the-loop
  - digital libraries
